{
  "id": 8867218915527,
  "title": "Softball Fan Bedding Set – Stylish Teal Yellow Sports Comforter for",
  "handle": "softball-fan-bedding-set-stylish-teal-yellow-sports-comforter-for",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your room's style with this vibrant Softball Fan Bedding Comforter Set, perfect for adding a sporty touch to any softball enthusiast's space. Designed for comfort and durability, it's a thoughtful way to show support for the game and enjoy a relaxing atmosphere.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Celebrate your passion for softball with a stylish bedding set that resonates with players and fans alike.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques for long-lasting color and finely stitched edges for enhanced durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm), offering an ultra-soft, smooth, breathable, and fade-resistant feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low for convenient maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set comes complete with a comfortable comforter, making it a ready-to-use bedding solution.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Offers personalization with two text input options, allowing for a unique touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin 68\"x90\"(173cm*218cm), Full 79\"x90\"(200cm*230cm), Queen 90x90\"(228cm*228cm), King 104\"x90\"(228cm*264cm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Fade-resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash, Tumble Dry Low</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Softball Lover Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
